			(property "Description" "SIM800L GSM/GPRS breakout, all 12 pins, numbered like the module: 1 NET(antenna) 2 VCC 3 RST 4 RXD 5 TXD 6 GND | 7 SPK- 8 SPK+ 9 MIC- 10 MIC+ 11 DTR 12 RING. VBAT is 3.4-4.4V NOT 5V. ~2A bursts: 1000uF low-ESR + 100nF at VBAT. MIC/SPK unused (no-connect pins)."
